function estiloXlsx(item){const {cell,row,r}=item,cls=cell.classList,rowCls=row.classList;if(cell.tagName==='TH'){if(cls.contains('period-b-head'))return 3;if(cls.contains('period-a-head'))return 4;if(cls.contains('summary-head')||cls.contains('variation-head'))return 5;if(cls.contains('subhead'))return 2;return 1}if(rowCls.contains('compare-summary-row'))return 6;if(rowCls.contains('group-row'))return 19;if(cls.contains('compare-delta')||cls.contains('variation-cell')){if(cls.contains('up')||cls.contains('var-up'))return 10;if(cls.contains('down')||cls.contains('var-down'))return 11;return 12}const esquerda=cls.contains('sticky-col')||cls.contains('left')||cell.cellIndex===0;return esquerda?(r%2?9:7):(r%2?8:0)}
function valorXlsx(txt,styleBase){const t=String(txt||'').trim();if(!t||t==='—')return {tipo:'s',valor:t,style:styleBase};if(/^[+-]?\\d{1,3}(?:\\.\\d{3})*(?:,\\d+)?%$/.test(t)||/^[+-]?\\d+(?:,\\d+)?%$/.test(t)){const n=Number(t.replace('%','').replace(/\\./g,'').replace(',','.'));return {tipo:'n',valor:n,style:styleBase===8?16:13}}if(/^[+-]?\\d{1,3}(?:\\.\\d{3})*(?:,\\d+)?‰$/.test(t)||/^[+-]?\\d+(?:,\\d+)?‰$/.test(t)){const n=Number(t.replace('‰','').replace(/\\./g,'').replace(',','.'));return {tipo:'n',valor:n,style:styleBase===8?17:14}}if(/^[+-]?\\d{1,3}(?:\\.\\d{3})*(?:,\\d+)?$/.test(t)||/^[+-]?\\d+(?:,\\d+)?$/.test(t)){const n=Number(t.replace(/\\./g,'').replace(',','.'));if(Number.isFinite(n))return {tipo:'n',valor:n,style:styleBase===8?18:15}}return {tipo:'s',valor:t,style:styleBase}}
